{"ID":"20240515131446-vt6y4qt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131446-vt6y4qt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131446-vt6y4qt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133010-70cfrc2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133010-70cfrc2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133010-70cfrc2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:653,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:653\u0026#125;","title":"015","type":"doc","updated":"20240515150834"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133010-70cfrc2","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 939px;","id":"20240515133010-70cfrc2","updated":"20240515150834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/26"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CC"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"39多歲，中等身材，略胖 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/26"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自述被西醫判定成憂鬱症，自殺過一次。先是因毫無睡意而失眠，吃安眠藥後憂鬱，西醫給予抗憂鬱藥後(已服八年)不知為何地想自殺，已自殺過一次。月經準時，但每次來只有一天，且色黑，此狀況已持續五年。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）睡眠：睡不著，毫無睡意。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）口渴：不停喝水，喜溫水，不喜冰水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）胃口：好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）大便：每日一行，一天三次，下利清穀。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）小便：時白時黃淡，一天小便十餘次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）手足：雙足冰、手冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）出汗：不易出汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（8）月經：準時，五年來每次月經來都只有一天，經血色黑。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（9）其他：一緊張就想吐(吐水)及想尿尿，自殺過一次，小腿癢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈沉細無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苔黃濕，舌右側有藍紫瘀塊"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2眼診"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：肝區有洞和圈紋，肺白有明顯黃塊、腎區反應不好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心血不足，腎陽虛，心陽不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、桂枝五錢、炙甘草五錢、黃連二錢、黃芩三錢、白芍五錢、阿膠三錢(分三包，烊化)、"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吳茱萸二錢、乾薑二錢巴戟天三錢、補骨脂三錢、生薑二片"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸二錢、細辛二錢、生附子三錢(布包)遠志五錢、鬱金五錢、柴胡三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每付用九碗煮成三碗，早晚餐飯前服用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二、HT-71(中安丸)，六兩，中餐及睡前各四十粒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心陽不足用桂枝甘草，辛甘為陽藥，心血不足用連芩，苦味補心。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天以補腎陽為主、補骨脂以補腎陰為主。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便已經一日三次，故當歸四逆湯架構去木通。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遠志令人鎮靜，柴胡鬱金舒解心情。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝排毒時，會大黑便及皮膚癢，此女的小腿癢屬肝排毒素。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}